# Purpose

This document defines exactly what Aura is required to do.

It serves as the functional contract between Product Design, Development, Testing and AI development tools such as Codex.

Every feature implemented in Aura must originate from this document.

---

# Product Summary

Aura is a premium smart home dashboard for iPhone that unifies televisions, streaming devices, lighting, home automation and smart accessories into one seamless experience.

Aura does not replace manufacturer applications.

Aura becomes the primary interface used every day.

---

# Product Goals

Aura must allow users to:

• Control entertainment devices
• Control lighting
• Build scenes
• Build automations
• Monitor device status
• Reduce interaction complexity
• Replace multiple manufacturer apps for daily use

---

# Non Goals

Aura is NOT intended to:

• Replace Apple Home
• Replace Philips Hue
• Replace tvOS
• Replace Home Assistant
• Become a programming platform

Aura focuses on premium everyday usability.

