# Acceptance Criteria

Aura Version 1.0 is considered complete when users can:

✓ Discover their devices automatically

✓ Control their Philips TV

✓ Directly control Apple TV through an accepted, verified implementation route

✓ Control Hue lighting

✓ Access HomeKit devices

✓ Build custom scenes

✓ Create automations

✓ Monitor diagnostics

✓ Personalize the interface

✓ Use Aura as their primary smart home application

---

# Product Success Metrics

Average launch time under 1.5 seconds.

95% successful device discovery.

95% successful scene execution.

Crash-free sessions above 99.8%.

Average interaction requires no more than two taps.

System Usability Scale (SUS) score above 90.

App Store rating target: 4.8 or higher.

---

# Requirement Priority

P0 — Critical
Must ship in Version 1.0.

P1 — High
Ships shortly after launch.

P2 — Medium
Planned future improvements.

P3 — Low
Experimental features.

Every new feature proposed for Aura must be assigned one of these priority levels before implementation.

